### SISBM CORE — Jalon 2 Phase 1
### Recette : CRUD + commandes sur boîtier réel
### VS Code « REST Client » ou JetBrains HTTP Client

@host = http://127.0.0.1:3333
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### ═════════════════════════════ SANTÉ
GET {{host}}/health

### ═════════════════════════════ CONNEXION
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@sisbm.ci", "password": "Sisbm2026!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### profil courant
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### rôles disponibles (alimente le formulaire de création d'utilisateur)
# @name roles
GET {{api}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@roleId = {{roles.response.body.data.0.id}}


### ═════════════════════════════ CRUD UTILISATEURS

### lister
GET {{api}}/users?page=1&perPage=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### créer — mot de passe 12 caractères minimum
# @name createUser
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "operateur2@sisbm.ci",
  "password": "MotDePasse2026!",
  "fullName": "Second Operateur",
  "phone": "+2250161899901",
  "roleId": "{{roleId}}",
  "status": "active"
}

###
@userId = {{createUser.response.body.data.id}}

### consulter
GET {{api}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### modifier
PATCH {{api}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Second Operateur SISBM" }

### suspendre — révoque aussi tous ses jetons
POST {{api}}/users/{{userId}}/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### changer SON mot de passe (exige le mot de passe courant)
POST {{api}}/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Sisbm2026!",
  "newPassword": "NouveauMotDePasse2026!",
  "newPassword_confirmation": "NouveauMotDePasse2026!"
}

### supprimer (logique) — impossible sur son propre compte
DELETE {{api}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═════════════════════════════ CRUD VÉHICULES

### lister, avec recherche floue sur l'immatriculation
GET {{api}}/vehicles?search=1234&status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### créer — seuil de vitesse PAR VÉHICULE (règle Jalon 2)
# @name createVehicle
POST {{api}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registration": "4321 ZZ 01",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Land Cruiser",
  "year": 2022,
  "vehicleType": "truck",
  "speedLimitKph": 90,
  "immobilizationEnabled": true
}

###
@vehicleId = {{createVehicle.response.body.data.id}}

### consulter — inclut le boîtier monté et la dernière position
GET {{api}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### modifier le seuil de vitesse
PATCH {{api}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "speedLimitKph": 80 }

### archiver (suppression logique)
DELETE {{api}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═════════════════════════════ CRUD BOÎTIERS

### lister les boîtiers EN STOCK, non montés
GET {{api}}/devices?unassigned=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### créer SANS synchronisation Flespi (préparation de parc)
# @name createDevice
POST {{api}}/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imei": "352625333222111",
  "model": "MV730",
  "manufacturer": "micodus",
  "hasRelay": true,
  "simMsisdn": "+2250161899910",
  "syncFlespi": false
}

###
@deviceId = {{createDevice.response.body.data.id}}

### créer AVEC synchronisation Flespi
### Le `0` de tête Micodus est ajouté automatiquement dans flespiIdent.
POST {{api}}/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imei": "352625333222222",
  "model": "MV730",
  "hasRelay": true,
  "syncFlespi": true,
  "flespiChannelId": 1234,
  "flespiDeviceTypeId": "Micodus MV730"
}

### consulter — inclut l'affectation en cours
GET {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### modifier
PATCH {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flespiDeviceId": 98765, "status": "active" }

### monter sur un véhicule — affectation DATÉE
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}", "installNotes": "Installation atelier Abidjan" }

### ⚠ remonter le MÊME boîtier sur un AUTRE véhicule → 409
### La contrainte EXCLUDE en base l'interdit (CM-01).
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": "aaaaaaaa-0000-4000-8000-000000000002" }

### démonter
DELETE {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### supprimer — refusé si le boîtier est encore monté (409)
DELETE {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═════════════════════════════ DIAGNOSTIC FLESPI
### Interroge FLESPI directement, pas notre base.
### Répond à : « le boîtier émet-il, ou est-ce nous qui perdons les trames ? »

### dernier message chez Flespi
GET {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/telemetry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### historique Flespi sur une fenêtre
GET {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/telemetry/history?from=2026-08-19T00:00:00Z&to=2026-08-19T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═════════════════════════════ COMMANDES SUR BOÎTIER RÉEL
### ⚠ Ces appels agissent sur du MATÉRIEL installé dans un véhicule.
### `reason` est obligatoire partout : c'est la pièce d'audit.

### catalogue des commandes disponibles
GET {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### historique des commandes émises
GET {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ── DIAGNOSTIC (sans risque — commencer par là) ──────────────

### R1 — forcer le boîtier à émettre position et état
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/request-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Verification de la remontee apres installation" }

### R2 — redémarrer le boîtier
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/reboot
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Boitier muet depuis 2 heures" }


### ── SUIVI RENFORCÉ ───────────────────────────────────────────

### T1 "1" — activer l'envoi fréquent de positions
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/start-tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Suivi renforce pendant le convoi Abidjan-Bouake" }

### T1 "0" — revenir au rythme normal
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/stop-tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Fin du convoi" }


### ── ALARME EMBARQUÉE ─────────────────────────────────────────

### S10 "1" — armer (vibration, remorquage)
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/arm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Vehicule stationne pour le week-end" }

### S10 "0" — désarmer
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/disarm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Reprise de service lundi matin" }


### ── SORTIE AUXILIAIRE ────────────────────────────────────────

### S11 — activer la sortie 1 (sirène, buzzer)
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/set-output
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Test de la sirene en atelier", "data": "0,1" }

### S11 — désactiver
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/set-output
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Fin du test sirene", "data": "0,0" }


### ── CONFIGURATION (sensible) ─────────────────────────────────

### A1 — numéro administrateur (sans le +)
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/set-admin-number
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Mise a jour du numero du responsable de flotte", "data": "2250707070707" }

### B1 — changer le mot de passe boîtier : "ancien,nouveau"
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Durcissement securite parc", "data": "123456,654321" }

### B2 — réinitialiser
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Mot de passe boitier perdu", "data": "123456" }

### C1 — APN. ⚠ Une valeur erronée rend le boîtier INJOIGNABLE.
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/set-apn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Passage operateur Orange CI", "data": "orange.ci,orange,orange" }

### ⚠ sans `data` → 422 E_MISSING_COMMAND_DATA
### Le garde-fou : un APN vide rendrait le boîtier irrécupérable.
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/set-apn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Test du garde-fou parametre manquant" }


### ── GÉOFENCES EMBARQUÉES (à valider Phase 2) ─────────────────

### G1 — "<id>,<type>,<lat>,<lng>,<rayon_m>"
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/add-geofence
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Zone depot port Abidjan", "data": "1,1,5.359952,-4.008256,500" }

### G2 — suppression par id
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/remove-geofence
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Zone depot obsolete", "data": "1" }


### ── COUPURE MOTEUR : REFUSÉE ICI ─────────────────────────────
### Renvoie 403 E_USE_IMMOBILIZATION_ENDPOINT.
### Cette route existe pour donner un message explicite plutôt qu'un 404.

POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/cut-engine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Tentative de contournement du garde-fou" }

### ✅ La vraie voie : contrôle de vitesse, fraîcheur de position, traçabilité
POST {{api}}/security/immobilizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "aaaaaaaa-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "reason": "Vehicule signale vole par le client"
}


### ═════════════════════════════ LIMITATION DE DÉBIT
### 10 requêtes/min sur /devices/*/commands et /security/*.
### Répéter cet appel plus de 10 fois → 429.
POST {{api}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands/request-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Test de la limitation de debit" }
